OL,3,GNEWSAPost office closure sparks fears
OL,4,Afor residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Exmouth have spoken of their
OL,7,Fdismay as the town's post office
OL,8,Fprepares to close, with some warning
OL,9,Fvulnerable residents could be left
OL,10,Fstruggling to access essential
OL,11,Fservices.
OL,13,FThe branch, which operates inside the
OL,14,Ftown's TGJones store - formerly
OL,15,FWHSmith, is shutting on Monday as part
OL,16,Fof a wider closure programme affecting
OL,17,Fabout 150 stores across the UK.
OL,19,FThe Post Office said it hoped to open a
OL,20,Freplacement branch as soon as possible,
OL,21,Falthough the process could take about
OL,22,Fsix months.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
